{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Promise"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"link","href":"SummarizationResult.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"SummarizationResult"}]},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"summarizestream","children":[{"type":"text","value":"summarizeStream?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional summarizeStream?: (options) => AsyncIterable<AGUIEvent>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/summarize/adapter.ts#L58","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/activities/summarize/adapter.ts:58"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Stream summarization of the given text.\nOptional - if not implemented, the activity layer will fall back to\nnon-streaming summarize and yield the result as a single chunk."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"parameters-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"options-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"options"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"SummarizationOptions.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"SummarizationOptions"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TProviderOptions"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"returns-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"AsyncIterable"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/AGUIEvent.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"AGUIEvent"}]},{"type":"text","value":">"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tmodel","text":"TModel","level":3},{"id":"tprovideroptions","text":"TProviderOptions","level":3},{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"types","text":"~types","level":3},{"id":"provideroptions","text":"providerOptions","level":4},{"id":"kind","text":"kind","level":3},{"id":"model","text":"model","level":3},{"id":"name","text":"name","level":3},{"id":"summarize","text":"summarize","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"options","text":"options","level":5},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"summarizestream","text":"summarizeStream?","level":3},{"id":"parameters-2","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"options-2","text":"options","level":5},{"id":"returns-2","text":"Returns","level":4}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/summarize/adapter.ts:28](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/summarize/adapter.ts#L28)\n\nSummarize adapter interface with pre-resolved generics.\n\nAn adapter is created by a provider function: `provider('model')` → `adapter`\nAll type resolution happens at the provider call site, not in this interface.\n\nGeneric parameters:\n- TModel: The specific model name (e.g., 'gpt-4o')\n- TProviderOptions: Provider-specific options (already resolved)\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TModel\n\n`TModel` *extends* `string` = `string`\n\n### TProviderOptions\n\n`TProviderOptions` *extends* `object` = `Record`\\<`string`, `unknown`\\>\n\n## Properties\n\n### ~types\n\n```ts\n~types: object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/summarize/adapter.ts:42](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/summarize/adapter.ts#L42)\n\n**`Internal`**\n\nType-only properties for inference. Not assigned at runtime.\n\n#### providerOptions\n\n```ts\nproviderOptions: TProviderOptions;\n```\n\n***\n\n### kind\n\n```ts\nreadonly kind: \"summarize\";\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/summarize/adapter.ts:33](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/summarize/adapter.ts#L33)\n\nDiscriminator for adapter kind - used by generate() to determine API shape\n\n***\n\n### model\n\n```ts\nreadonly model: TModel;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/summarize/adapter.ts:37](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/summarize/adapter.ts#L37)\n\nThe model this adapter is configured for\n\n***\n\n### name\n\n```ts\nreadonly name: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/summarize/adapter.ts:35](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/summarize/adapter.ts#L35)\n\nAdapter name identifier\n\n***\n\n### summarize\n\n```ts\nsummarize: (options) => Promise<SummarizationResult>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/summarize/adapter.ts:49](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/summarize/adapter.ts#L49)\n\nSummarize the given text\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### options\n\n[`SummarizationOptions`](SummarizationOptions.md)\\<`TProviderOptions`\\>\n\n#### Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<[`SummarizationResult`](SummarizationResult.md)\\>\n\n***\n\n### summarizeStream?\n\n```ts\noptional summarizeStream?: (options) => AsyncIterable<AGUIEvent>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/summarize/adapter.ts:58](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/summarize/adapter.ts#L58)\n\nStream summarization of the given text.\nOptional - if not implemented, the activity layer will fall back to\nnon-streaming summarize and yield the result as a single chunk.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### options\n\n[`SummarizationOptions`](SummarizationOptions.md)\\<`TProviderOptions`\\>\n\n#### Returns\n\n`AsyncIterable`\\<[`AGUIEvent`](../type-aliases/AGUIEvent.md)\\>\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: SummarizeAdapter\ntitle: SummarizeAdapter\n---\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/summarize/adapter.ts:28](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/summarize/adapter.ts#L28)\n\nSummarize adapter interface with pre-resolved generics.\n\nAn adapter is created by a provider function: `provider('model')` → `adapter`\nAll type resolution happens at the provider call site, not in this interface.\n\nGeneric parameters:\n- TModel: The specific model name (e.g., 'gpt-4o')\n- TProviderOptions: Provider-specific options (already resolved)\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TModel\n\n`TModel` *extends* `string` = `string`\n\n### TProviderOptions\n\n`TProviderOptions` *extends* `object` = `Record`\\<`string`, `unknown`\\>\n\n## Properties\n\n### ~types\n\n```ts\n~types: object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/summarize/adapter.ts:42](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/summarize/adapter.ts#L42)\n\n**`Internal`**\n\nType-only properties for inference. Not assigned at runtime.\n\n#### providerOptions\n\n```ts\nproviderOptions: TProviderOptions;\n```\n\n***\n\n### kind\n\n```ts\nreadonly kind: \"summarize\";\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/summarize/adapter.ts:33](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/summarize/adapter.ts#L33)\n\nDiscriminator for adapter kind - used by generate() to determine API shape\n\n***\n\n### model\n\n```ts\nreadonly model: TModel;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/summarize/adapter.ts:37](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/summarize/adapter.ts#L37)\n\nThe model this adapter is configured for\n\n***\n\n### name\n\n```ts\nreadonly name: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/summarize/adapter.ts:35](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/summarize/adapter.ts#L35)\n\nAdapter name identifier\n\n***\n\n### summarize\n\n```ts\nsummarize: (options) => Promise<SummarizationResult>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/summarize/adapter.ts:49](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/summarize/adapter.ts#L49)\n\nSummarize the given text\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### options\n\n[`SummarizationOptions`](SummarizationOptions.md)\\<`TProviderOptions`\\>\n\n#### Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<[`SummarizationResult`](SummarizationResult.md)\\>\n\n***\n\n### summarizeStream?\n\n```ts\noptional summarizeStream?: (options) => AsyncIterable<AGUIEvent>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/summarize/adapter.ts:58](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/summarize/adapter.ts#L58)\n\nStream summarization of the given text.\nOptional - if not implemented, the activity layer will fall back to\nnon-streaming summarize and yield the result as a single chunk.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### options\n\n[`SummarizationOptions`](SummarizationOptions.md)\\<`TProviderOptions`\\>\n\n#### Returns\n\n`AsyncIterable`\\<[`AGUIEvent`](../type-aliases/AGUIEvent.md)\\>\n"}
